# Confusion pairs

When building or reviewing Match confusion pairs for any certification, read `.claude/skills/confusion-pair-builder/SKILL.md` and follow it. Run the report-only auditor in `.claude/agents/pair-contrast-auditor.md` before changing a batch from its findings. The copies in `.agents/` are for other assistants.

A hint fails when it repeats a word of three or more characters that appears in its own label and in no other side's label or hint. The word `one` counts. Vercel Git deployments are off, so a merged batch is not live until a manual deploy, and the pull request report says whether anything was deployed.
